    "https://careers.hprod.onehcm.usg.edu/psc/careers/CAREERS/HRMS/c/HRS_HRAM_FL.HRS_CG_SEARCH_FL.GBL?FOCUS=Applicant&SiteId=28000": {
      "title": "Clayton State University Careers",
      "description": "Careers Skip to Main Content Press Control+M to start dragging object ptnbsid=bBJdVIjdp9wNyOS5oK9XYZm5xB4%3d Back Clayton State University Careers Search Category Name Search keywords Search in... Menu Category All Company Directory Job Data No results to display Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Actions Search My Preferences Help Sign Out Clayton State University Careers More Actions Welcome Sign In New User Thank you for your interest in employment at Clayton State University. You can search and review career opportunities from this page without creating an account. When you are ready to apply, log in or create a new applicant account, and you will be able to: View all career opportunities. Search specific criteria to find careers that interest you. Set up a search agent to notify you when positions are posted that match your search criteria. If you need any technical support or assistance completing an employment application, please don't hesitate to contact our dedicated USG Service Desk at (877) 251-2644 or support@usg.edu . For questions about positions at Clayton State University, please contact the Office of Human Resources at HumanResources@clayton.edu . Our applicant portal is designed to be accessible from a variety of devices, including desktops, laptops, and mobile devices. Due to an Oracle Known Issue, we recommend that Mac OS users browse and apply using a web browser other than Safari for the best experience. The University System of Georgia's and Clayton State University's policies on recruitment and selection, as well as Clayton State's Positions of Trust listing, can be found here: Resources & Policies - Clayton State University and https://www.usg.edu/hr/manual . Additionally, Clayton State University supports Freedom of Expression, as stated in our Freedom of Expression and Academic Freedom policy, which can be found online at https://www.usg.edu/policymanual/section6/C2653 . The Jeanne Clery Campus Safety Act and the Higher Education Act (HEA) fire safety provisions require institutions of higher education to publish an Annual Security Report and Annual Fire Safety Report. These reports include crime and fire statistics for the three most recently completed calendar years, institutional policies and procedures for reporting crimes, and current policies concerning the security of, and access to, campus facilities and residences, as well as security considerations in the maintenance of campus facilities.The reports are available online at: https://www.clayton.edu/public-safety/clery-act-and-crime-reporting/annual-security-and-crime-report . If you would like to retain a copy of the report, you may print it from your browser or request a paper copy by emailing the institution at humanresources@clayton.edu . View All Jobs My Job Notifications My Job Applications My Favorite Jobs My Saved Searches My Account Information Clayton State University Careers Sign In New User"
    },
